{"seq":3,"slug":"parallel-fanout","title":"并行扇出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns/parallel-fanout","wordCount":1331,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行扇出\">并行扇出</h1><p>有些问题不知道答案藏在哪个方向，与其让一个 agent 顺序试遍所有路，不如让一群 agent 同时往不同方向冲，最后看谁找到了。这就是并行扇出——多智能体里最能体现「广度优先」威力、也最容易把账单烧穿的拓扑。它和流水线正好相反：流水线让 agent 排队接力，扇出让 agent 同时散开。这一篇讲清楚扇出的形状、它如何用 token 换时间、以及那两个绕不开的代价：成本曲线和结果归并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>并行扇出把同一个任务复制成多个独立分支，让若干 agent 同时、互不通信地探索，最后由一个归并步骤把分散的结果汇合成单一输出。它是广度优先搜索在 agent 拓扑上的直接实现：分支负责「铺开」，归并负责「收敛」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T[任务] --&gt; SP[扇出调度]&#10;  SP --&gt; A1[分支 agent 1&lt;br/&gt;独立探索]&#10;  SP --&gt; A2[分支 agent 2&lt;br/&gt;独立探索]&#10;  SP --&gt; A3[分支 agent 3&lt;br/&gt;独立探索]&#10;  A1 --&gt; MG[归并/裁决]&#10;  A2 --&gt; MG&#10;  A3 --&gt; MG&#10;  MG --&gt; O[单一输出]\">flowchart TD\n  T[任务] --&gt; SP[扇出调度]\n  SP --&gt; A1[分支 agent 1&lt;br/&gt;独立探索]\n  SP --&gt; A2[分支 agent 2&lt;br/&gt;独立探索]\n  SP --&gt; A3[分支 agent 3&lt;br/&gt;独立探索]\n  A1 --&gt; MG[归并/裁决]\n  A2 --&gt; MG\n  A3 --&gt; MG\n  MG --&gt; O[单一输出]</pre><p>扇出有两种语义，区分它们对设计很重要。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扇出语义</th>\n<th>各分支任务</th>\n<th>归并方式</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分区式（map）</td>\n<td>不同子区域，互补</td>\n<td>拼接/汇总</td>\n<td>多源调研、分文件改代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冗余式（best-of-n）</td>\n<td>同一任务，多次尝试</td>\n<td>择优/投票</td>\n<td>高风险决策、提升正确率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分区式是「把大任务切块并行做」，冗余式是「同一件事做 n 遍取最好」。前者偏向<a href=\"supervisor-worker\">主管-工人</a>里主管把异构子任务并行派出去，后者则与<a href=\"../coordination/conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a>里的投票/择优机制深度绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-token-换墙钟时间-扇出的核心交易\">用 token 换墙钟时间：扇出的核心交易</h2><p>扇出的根本价值是把串行探索变成并行探索，用更多 token 换更短的墙钟时间。设单分支耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个分支并行的总墙钟时间理想情况下仍约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（受限于最慢分支），而串行做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个方向则需约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。时间上是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍加速，但 token 成本也变成约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍——这笔交易只在「时间比 token 贵」时才划算。</p>\n<p>这条「不省 token、只省时间」的性质必须时刻记牢，它在<a href=\"../foundations/single-vs-multi\">单体与多体权衡</a>里已被点明：并行不降低总开销。所以扇出适合的场景是高价值、对延迟敏感、且分支之间真正独立的任务；反过来，如果分支之间需要频繁互通中间结果，那它们就不是真正独立的，硬扇出只会让你不停地在分支间搬运状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本爆炸-扇出最容易踩穿的坑\">成本爆炸：扇出最容易踩穿的坑</h2><p>扇出最现实的危险是成本爆炸。它有两种叠加方式。第一种是宽度爆炸：分支数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 设得过大，token 直接线性翻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。第二种更隐蔽——深度爆炸：如果分支 agent 自己又去扇出下一层，总开销就从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为扇出深度），这与<a href=\"supervisor-worker\">主管-工人模式</a>里讲的递归 spawn 是同一个魔鬼。</p>\n<p>控制扇出成本有三道闸门：硬性上限分支数；禁止分支再扇出（扁平化拓扑）；以及给整个扇出设全局 token 预算，超预算就提前归并已完成的分支。还有一个常被忽视的优化——早停：如果某个分支已经给出了足够好的答案，没必要等其余分支跑完。这些预算与闸门的工程实现是<a href=\"../practice/cost-observability\">成本与可观测性</a>的核心议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归并-扇出真正的难点\">归并：扇出真正的难点</h2><p>铺开容易，收敛难。归并步骤要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个可能互相矛盾的分支结果合成一个可信的输出，这是扇出最考验设计的地方。归并策略取决于扇出语义：分区式归并通常是拼接加去重（把各子区域的发现合并，删掉重叠），冗余式归并则是择优或投票（多个分支对同一问题给答案，选多数或选最优）。</p>\n<p>冗余式归并的好处有理论支撑：若每个分支独立正确的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &gt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个分支做多数投票，整体正确率会随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（这是孔多塞陪审团定理的直接应用）。但「独立」是关键前提——如果所有分支用同一个模型、同一份提示，它们的错误高度相关，投票就失去意义，多个分支会一起犯同一个错，形成「集体幻觉」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R1[分支结果 1] --&gt; CK{是否同质&lt;br/&gt;错误相关?}&#10;  R2[分支结果 2] --&gt; CK&#10;  R3[分支结果 3] --&gt; CK&#10;  CK --&gt;|高度相关| WARN[投票失效&lt;br/&gt;谨防集体幻觉]&#10;  CK --&gt;|足够独立| VOTE[多数投票&lt;br/&gt;正确率随 n 提升]&#10;  VOTE --&gt; OUT[归并输出]\">flowchart TD\n  R1[分支结果 1] --&gt; CK{是否同质&lt;br/&gt;错误相关?}\n  R2[分支结果 2] --&gt; CK\n  R3[分支结果 3] --&gt; CK\n  CK --&gt;|高度相关| WARN[投票失效&lt;br/&gt;谨防集体幻觉]\n  CK --&gt;|足够独立| VOTE[多数投票&lt;br/&gt;正确率随 n 提升]\n  VOTE --&gt; OUT[归并输出]</pre><p>如何让分支保持独立、以及当结果冲突时如何裁决，是<a href=\"../coordination/conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a>的专属主题——扇出把冲突制造出来，冲突解决负责收场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>并行扇出是广度优先搜索的拓扑实现：分支同时独立探索，归并步骤收敛成单一输出。</li>\n<li>两种语义：分区式（切块并行做，拼接归并）和冗余式（同任务做 n 遍，择优/投票归并）。</li>\n<li>核心交易是用约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍 token 换约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍墙钟加速，不省成本只省时间，仅当时间比 token 贵时划算。</li>\n<li>最大风险是成本爆炸（宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），用分支上限、禁止再扇出、全局预算和早停来控。</li>\n<li>归并是真正的难点；冗余式投票需分支「独立」才有效，否则错误相关会导致集体幻觉，裁决细节见<a href=\"../coordination/conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行扇出","id":"并行扇出"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用 token 换墙钟时间：扇出的核心交易","id":"用-token-换墙钟时间-扇出的核心交易"},{"level":2,"text":"成本爆炸：扇出最容易踩穿的坑","id":"成本爆炸-扇出最容易踩穿的坑"},{"level":2,"text":"归并：扇出真正的难点","id":"归并-扇出真正的难点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流水线与交接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns/pipeline-handoff"},"next":{"title":"共享上下文与记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination/shared-context-memory"}}